kill bill star michael madsen has been  arrested just one month after his son's  suspected suicide made headlines  according to multiple reports the  64-year old actor was arrested wednesday  night in malibu on suspicion of  misdemeanor trespassing the la sheriff's  department deputies were called to  madsen's malibu home which he was  renting at around 9pm wednesday night by  the property's owner who detained the  actor in a citizen's arrest according to  lasd arrest records obtained by e.t  madsen was then transported to west  hills hospital before being taken to the  sheriff's lost hill station where he was  issued a 500 citation and released  thursday morning it's unclear at this  time why the owner of the property  madsen had been renting called the  police on the actor but his arrest comes  just one month after the death of his 26  year old son hudson who died of a  gunshot wound to the head on a suspected  suicide on the hawaiian island of oahu  shortly after his son's tragic passing  the reservoir dog star shared the final  text message he received from his son  with the los angeles times a text  reading simply i love you dad  quote i am in shock as my son whom i  just spoke with a few days ago said he  was happy hudson the god son of quentin  tarantino was madsen's eldest son with  his wife deanna madsen the two also  share sons calvin and luke madsen also  shares sons christian and max with his  ex-wife janine bissignano following  hudson's death the family released a  statement to metro stating that they are  heartbroken and overwhelmed by grief and  pain adding his memory and light will be  remembered by all who knew and loved him  [Music]  you
 

